<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 23.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 23.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 190.59    0.85</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	13.81    1.81</p>
<p> 3   Aust Tour		 9.62    0.78</p>
<p> 4   Cudgen R.Z.	     9.43    2.65</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.14    1.07</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   9.03    0.94</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 8.77    1.15</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	   8.68    1.88</p>
<p> 9   Centro Prop	     8.59    2.24</p>
<p>10   Davids Limited	  8.55    1.17</p>
<p>11   Natl Consol	     8.33    1.08</p>
<p>12   Ipoh			8.26    2.18</p>
<p>13   Schroder Prop	   8.19    2.26</p>
<p>14   Countrywide-PP	  8.13    1.25</p>
<p>15   Colonial Mutual	 7.96    1.34</p>
